DESCRIPTION:King Tut Day falls on November 4\, the date in 1922 when workme
 n clearing ground in the Valley of the Kings uncovered the first step of a
  staircase leading down to the tomb of Tutankhamun. No founder\, founding 
 year or sponsoring organization for the observance appears in any reliable
  record — it marks the discovery rather than any decision to commemorate
  it.\n\nhttps://todaycelebrates.com/holiday/king-tut-day/
